  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characters:
  - portrait: {fileID: -841876788, guid: 2729732451864374d84851f9f566f3c5, type: 3}
    dialogues:
    - "Attack nearby enemies to knockback them.\r"
    - I'm trained to attack from a long distance.
    - I've heard killing enemies upsets some Deities...
    - If we pray to the Deities, we receive a blessing.
    - I wish I could relax and eat pastry...
  - portrait: {fileID: 226725293, guid: 2729732451864374d84851f9f566f3c5, type: 3}
    dialogues:
    - King Laurinus can infest tiles with evil magic.
    - Each new battle, brings new memories.
    - Enemies release Crystals  enhancing our prowess.
  - portrait: {fileID: 1501421962, guid: 2729732451864374d84851f9f566f3c5, type: 3}
    dialogues:
    - Using specific Spells upsets the Deities.. beware!
    - I can use the Magnet to attract Enemies.
    - Some enemies follow you around... so annoying.
    - If we lure Enemies into a Trap, we gain Crystals.
    - Crystals have the power to constrain Deities.
